# No Kiriage Mangan on dealer tsumo in both rulesets: 4 han 30 fu = 3900 all (NOT 4000 all)
# (rules.md §1 kiriage_mangan_enabled, §3.2, §4 item 20).
# Turn 1: Seats 0, 1, 2 tsumogiri; Seat 3 discards 2m -> Dealer Seat 0 calls chi:34m and discards 9m.
# Seats 1, 2, 3 tsumogiri; Dealer Seat 0 draws 7s and wins by tsumo!
# Scoring for Seat 0 (dealer, East):
#   Hand: 678m 234p 06s 88p + chi 234m + tsumo 7s (dora ind 7p -> dora 8p x2; red 0s -> aka:1)
#   Yaku: tanyao (1) + dora:2 (88p) + aka:1 (0s) = 4 han
#   Fu: 20 base + 2 tsumo = 22 -> 30 fu
#   Dealer 4 han 30 fu tsumo: 3900 all (+11700, NOT 4000 all)!

